.B help
for the shell's commands, and
.B man
.I name
for any page here;
.B man \-k
.I word
finds pages by their NAME line.
Start with
.BR sh (1),
.BR boot (7),
.BR ipc (7)
and
.BR hier (7).
The source tree's docs/ explains each subsystem at length (docs/index.md).
